alException</a> object.</p><p class="paragraph">Your app should inspect the <a href="../../../external/com.stripe.stripeterminal.external.models/-terminal-exception/index.html">TerminalException</a> to decide how to proceed.</p><span class="kdoc-tag"><h4 class="">Return</h4><p class="paragraph">A <a href="../../../external/com.stripe.stripeterminal.external.callable/-cancelable/index.html">Cancelable</a> that allows the operation to be canceled when the SDK is not waiting for a network response.</p></span><h4 class="">Parameters</h4><div class="table"><div class="table-row" data-filterable-current=":terminalsdk:core:dokkaHtmlPartial/release" data-filterable-set=":terminalsdk:core:dokkaHtmlPartial/release"><div class="main-subrow keyValue "><div class=""><span class="inline-flex"><div><u><span><span>callback</span></span></u></div></span></div><div><div class="title"><p class="paragraph">The callback that will be called when the operation completes.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
