ernal.models/-terminal-exception/index.html">TerminalException</a>. The same method will be called with no <a href="../../../external/com.stripe.stripeterminal.external.models/-terminal-exception/index.html">TerminalException</a> if the installation has completed without error.</p><p class="paragraph">If no reader is connected, a <a href="../../../external/com.stripe.stripeterminal.external.models/-terminal-exception/index.html">TerminalException</a> is thrown.</p></div></div>
